{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>天水圍發生持刀傷人案。今日（6日）凌晨3時許，警方接獲市民報案指，有8人在天秀路8號天一商城對開巴士站打架，其間有人用刀施襲，救護員接報到場，3名男子均受輕傷，清醒由救護車送往天水圍醫院接受治理，警方在場調查案件。</p><p>就現場所見，警員封鎖現場調查，附近花槽有一張染血紙巾。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一張染血紙巾。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161901150144827392796381.jpeg/nS1O5EaEk_1XG4qXmYOWjnScrXRwQMlIsZ6EzIuehMw\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一張染血紙巾。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖現場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161901158164598784436518.jpeg/e6xUgbKCqYnhVRAHphpO5VwxFueyG-9vVxNJ5G0TSeQ\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖現場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖現場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161901162149318656480152.jpeg/rdQ_ZCXOsPMymWV-ldRrQFRpK_355sD4c0PhLUlD4S0\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖現場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖現場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161901154175684608987105.jpeg/SHcfBC-eBusdoXS1ojDwpQ8n9Cb8hQKL9uhjlMzoY5Q\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖現場調查。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T21:18:49.206359+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}